<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts $.50 higher.</p>
<p>Top $54.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>US 2-3 couple pkgs 278 lbs 53.50</p>
<p>US 2-4  package 292 lbs    52.50</p>
<p>US 1-2 shipment 218 lbs    51.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Under 500 lbs $.50-2.00 higher; over 500 lbs 2.00-3.00</p>
<p>higher. Top 58.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-450 lbs    44.50</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-550 lbs    54.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
</text>
